    <section-starting-page>
        <title>Inspectra</title>
        <description>
            Supply-chain security commands - OSV.dev audit, package inspection, pub.dev trust and typosquat checks -
            plus format and lint checks, Trivy security scans, public API dumps and a coverage gate for Dart and
            Flutter packages: run by build_runner and the command line, configured in one YAML file, and built on the
            Dart toolchain, Trivy, OSV.dev and pub.dev.
        </description>

